<title>USA: Oppenheimer Capital FY 97 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Oppenheimer Capital FY 97 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer Capital LP said Monday that net income rose to $13.6 million or $0.88 per unit for the fourth fiscal quarter ended April 30 compared to $10.9 million or $0.71 a share in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Operating income of its Oppenheimer Capital subsidiary for the fourth quarter increased to $20.9 million from $16.7 million the year before.</p>
<p>Oppenheimer Capital LP has a 67.5 percent general partner stake in the investment management firm Oppenheimer Capital.</p>
</text>
